Two subdirectories hold separate series with their own terms; see the README
in each:

- protobuf/ changes the protobuf sources bundled with MySQL. It is licensed
  like them, under the BSD 3-Clause License.
- libmysql/ changes the MySQL C API client library. Its terms are those of
  this directory plus the Universal FOSS Exception, matching upstream's terms
  for libmysqlclient.

Context lines are from upstream and remain the copyright of their authors
under upstream's terms.
